      "value": "Please make a separate bug report for:\n\n`And another thing, the portals are all using separate grab-pass distortion which I​ assume may not be GPU instanced because when looking towards them my frame timing kills itself.`\n\nThat is not a feature request. This will help get your requests/reports organized and inventoried better.",
