  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "posted this on twitter before, but I don't think this was posted here. The mirrors in the hub really need to have a toggle button, too many people sit in front of it and for some its a pain to have to stand in front of a mirror which automatically turns on when near it when it kills your frames / makes you motion sick. And another thing, the portals are all using separate grab-pass distortion which i assume may not be gpu instanced because when looking towards them my frame timing kills itself.",
